'''The Bastion''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Wyld Woods}} in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Purpose ==
Located in the center of '''The Bastion''' is a wilted tree. Clicking on it grants a message, which hints at interacting with the tree with {{Item|Muted Bark}}. Interacting with the log with purple particles emanating from it whilst the player is holding {{Item|Muted Bark|amount=20}} opens up a hole in the tree, revealing an {{Item|Enigma Soul}}.

